.TH FALLOCATE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fallocate \- Linux x86-64 syscall 285
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int fallocate(int descriptor, int mode, off_t offset, off_t length);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Allocates or manipulates disk space in a file.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fallocate (2)
